  "Id": 2490,
  "Title": "AKU-ISMC Completion Ceremony 2020",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "AKU-ISMC students enjoy a socially distanced completion ceremony on 13 November 2020",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass8D3906847A774388AB519E5455ED9E6D\"><p><br>On 13 November 2020,&#160;AKU-ISMC students enjoyed a socially distanced completion ceremony at the Aga Khan Centre. The ceremony started with speeches delivered&#160;by&#160;Professor Leif Stenberg, AKU-ISMC Dean, and&#160;Professor Stephen Lyon,&#160;Head of Educational Programmes. AKU-ISMC&#160;valedictorians,&#160;Alina Sabah&#160;and&#160;Razia Shaheen have also seized the opportunity to share with&#160;the audience&#160;their study&#160;experiences and&#160;visions, as well as their aspirations&#160;for the future.\u200b <br></p><p><br></p>\r\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https&#58;//www.youtube.com/embed/SXk9fkYPLUQ\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\r\n<p>\u200b<br></p></div>",
